    lm "现在我不禁开始想，如果我……她还会发出什么别的声音。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_7c9a953f:
    lm "{cps=20}如果我摸我妈妈……{w=0.35}就在这里……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_e385828f:
    h "{size=+5}咳！莱娜……？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_16b1419b:
    h "宝贝，你在干什么？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_28647ed4:
    l "哦！我、我不是故意……呃，摸到那里。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d2da1ac4:
    l "对不起妈，我只是一时忘乎所以，然后我……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_3fad6fc8:
    l "我看不清了……{size=-5}从这边看。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_2fd7f8d4:
    h "没事的宝贝，意外难免。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_847344f6:
    l "{size=-5}是的……我又要说抱歉了。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6b69df65:
    h "听着，我很感谢你的按摩，不过我们是不是该先停一下？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_424558c6:
    l "好、好的！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4af065f4:
    h "我们一起看纪录片怎么样？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_70d8a73f:
    h "挺有意思的，我也想听听你的看法。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5bcde770:
    l "好、好的，听起来不错……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_f8c1b3b7:
    hm "嗯，刚才那下……有点尴尬。我也不太清楚发生了什么，但我觉得没必要小题大做。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ed2fe45a:
    hm "我们相处得这么愉快，女儿只是黏人一点，仅此而已……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_36e9307b:
    h "宝贝，过来吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_a53c0567:
    l "你为什么那样看着我……？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6a3c061e:
    h "{size=+5}你一直都穿着这个？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4ddb4e98:
    h "{size=+5}天哪，莱娜！我不是说过别穿那么暴露的衣服吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_60a2d4ed:
    l "{size=+5}嗯？！你自己才这样！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_21334aa6:
    l "{size=+5}看看你自己那身打扮，妈！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4d97684b:
    l "{size=+5}再说了，现在是大热天，而且……埃里克又不在！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c5cabcb0:
    h "呃……抱歉，你说得也有道理。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_9e1d5fec:
    h "今晚确实挺暖和的。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_938a2ba9:
    l "往里挤挤！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_dbfe20fa:
    h "哦！嘿……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d1665a6c:
    l "看？这样多舒服！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_cd610210:
    h "听我说宝贝，如果我反应过度了，我很抱歉。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_bf1e615c:
    h "只是……你长大得太快了，我很担心你。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_af21e4d1:
    l "哎呀，妈妈！我很感激啦，但我已经不是小孩了。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_77b5fac3:
    l "我可以自己决定穿什么……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c6ee0ce4:
    h "可你刚才还叫我「妈妈」！哈哈！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_47b32435:
    l "哎呀！一时口误……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c81ca2b9:
    h "没关系，我听着挺可爱的！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_b71b115e:
    h "还有啊，莱娜，你想要的话我随时都可以当你妈妈，嘿嘿～"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_cb101511:
    h "所以不管你多大，你永远是我的小天使。你已经长成大姑娘了，这一点我很难接受……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_2397ed21:
    l "{size=+5}妈——，你就是个心软鬼！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_71fe8eb0:
    h "怎么？我就不能对自己的女儿亲近一点？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_63632d33:
    l "不是不是，只是……我以为那些腻歪的话你只对埃里克说。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4c64b8b3:
    h "哎呀。我对你们两个一样爱！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_b311dc00:
    lm "真的吗？完全看不出来……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4cfa8e49:
    h "再说了，你不是跟我说过去年很寂寞吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_27161e4e:
    h "你多点爱才好！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ecfedcfa:
    l "嗯，大概吧……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6f07ff23:
    h "这个夏天我们做个约定怎么样？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4889291b:
    l "哦！这听起来有意思！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_bf42274a:
    h "我们多花点时间相处，就我们两个。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_3c1f4d63:
    l "你是说……像母女谈心那样的时间？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_692771b8:
    h "正是！我们想做什么都可以。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_80c0e545:
    l "好耶～！你是全世界最棒的妈妈！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_bfc4033c:
    n "夜渐深，赫尔加和女儿的关系越发亲近，这些年来第一次真心地享受彼此的陪伴。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5d0c3418:
    n "赫尔加对这次机会非常感激。可她心里清楚，终身养成的惯性并不是那么容易克服的。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_a0279124:
    n "她对儿子那不加掩饰的偏爱，以及对莱娜叛逆天性的下意识不满，一直在两人之间制造着一种无形的张力。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c5f6a847:
    l "{size=+5}呃！这里面也太热了……！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_770736ab:
    h "这就是热带的夏天嘛！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_edde83f7:
    h "我习惯到处跑了，不过偶尔也会怀念北方……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8855f36c:
    l "是啊妈，随便啦！我真受不了了……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_152127f2:
    l "所以别介意，我要脱上衣了！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5cf02351:
    h "宝贝，我不知道这是不是个好主意……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_875a5251:
    l "拜托啦！我里面还有内衣。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_b0085a8e:
    l "我又不会光着身子到处跑。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_0a0b937a:
    h "好吧好吧！脱吧。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_98e2dd4e:
    h "但别让你哥哥撞见你这副样子。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_fa0a2a57:
    l "知道啦！你真是个爱操心的……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_18aca659:
    h "天哪，莱娜，你也太瘦了！有没有好好吃饭？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_848b1cec:
    l "{cps=30}哎呀，{w=0.35}谢谢妈……{w=0.5}{size=-5}{cps=20}我现在好幸福……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_51ffbb04:
    h "哦宝贝，我不是那个意思！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_41b5bf4c:
    l "你看……我虽然没你这么丰满，但我很健康！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_f052e197:
    h "好吧好吧！抱歉……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_7a3ea681:
    h "现在仔细一看……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_f4d54577:
    h "你的身材其实相当年轻健美，自有一种魅力。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6daa19c8:
    l "你这么说的话……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_82737f21:
    h "真的！你很美，莱娜。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5dbd588d:
    h "不要让任何人告诉你不是这样，好吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ab8bb15f:
    l "唉，我还不知道呢，妈……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_788b814d:
    h "真的！我像你这么大的时候，做梦都想那么瘦！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_012bbf28:
    l "{cps=20}我不知道……{w=0.5}我只是希望我有你的……{w=0.35}身材。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5e950262:
    h "我保证你很快就会有属于自己的曲线！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_00a06de1:
    l "嘿！至少该大的地方已经有点料了，对吧？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6c0d19ae:
    hm "哦！哇……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_0816f9bc:
    hm "我不该盯着看的，可是……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_9e72a279:
    hm "我女儿真的出落成这么优秀的年轻女性了。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d7e51a02:
    l "所以，你怎么看……？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_0b7257ad:
    l "毕竟这是我欠你的！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_a9d017eb:
    n "莱娜转过身，在母亲面前俏皮地扭了扭她几乎遮不住的屁股，看得赫尔加脸上一阵发红。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_a8c9d204:
    h "宝贝，请别这样……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_e55cad82:
    h "我觉得我们不该讨论你的……屁股……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ae914b71:
    l "咦？可你刚才还在夸我的身材！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8af3253c:
    l "{cps=20}现在别那么害羞嘛，{w=0.35}{size=-5}妈妈……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_9c15517c:
    h "嘿嘿！好吧，你说得也有道理……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_1f2e4af7:
    h "你的身材确实很好看。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_76a92fa6:
    h "我的好基因可全给你了，不是吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8f6f6cbf:
    lm "我妈真的就这么说了，哈哈！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8eac8404:
    lm "我没想到她是这种人……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_91a9f15d:
    lm "也许我再多露一点，她就会开始注意我了……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8b49a6b5:
    lm "靠，我到底在想什么？！她是我妈！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_4d750842:
    lm "刚才按摩时我做的事已经够冒险了……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c082b4d4:
    lm "也许埃里克说得对，我该清醒一点，{w=0.5}{cps=15}可是……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_41d8d01e:
    l "妈妈……我能问你一件事吗？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d84971d0:
    h "当、当然，宝贝。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_0f5406ae:
    l "{cps=20}你怎么看……{w=0.35}{i}它们{/i}？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_cefaf3b4:
    hm "天哪！我刚夸了她的屁股，现在她就……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_a945cffa:
    hm "{size=+5}她想聊自己的胸部？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8d42a054:
    l "我只是有时对自己的胸部很没自信……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_70e0daf9:
    l "不会有男生喜欢这么瘦、这么平胸的女孩吧……？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ffad4c10:
    h "哎呀宝贝，别这么说！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_8f0225ae:
    l "可是妈！你的又大又丰满……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_392e9037:
    h "什、什么……" with hpunch

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_0d833301:
    hm "{size=+5}现在她在跟我比了？！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_3bd01e53:
    hm "这话题要往哪儿去……？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ee499141:
    hm "我现在必须得打断她！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_e36ade02:
    l "{cps=15}所以~ {cps=10}{w=0.5}妈妈……？"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d648407b:
    hm "可天哪！我的小宝贝真的很可爱……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_b18672e9:
    hm "而且她对自己的身体这么没自信……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_07113cad:
    hm "作为她妈妈，我必须说点什么！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_5208b6e3:
    h "亲爱的，那只是……遗传……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_dc3c2311:
    h "再说了，胸部越大也未必就越好。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_3a12741a:
    h "相信我，那会又重又难受。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_c89d5f1f:
    h "给它们一点时间长大，好吗？你还年轻。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ec25c0a4:
    h "还有，记住，每个女人都不一样！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ff55aaf4:
    h "你现在这样就很好，我的小南瓜……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_616427dc:
    l "哎呀！谢谢妈妈，你总是知道该说什么！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ab995fa7:
    lm "妈妈脸都红透了，嘿嘿~"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_fa029e62:
    lm "我还以为她肯定会骂我呢！"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_45288e64:
    hm "莱娜想当乖天使的时候还真是个小天使……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_fe7cdfd0:
    hm "也许跟她的事最终没那么难。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_ddedb981:
    n "母女俩在纪录片声中很快睡着了，忙了一整天都累了。"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_6787acc8:
    n "正是这样温馨的小片刻，让一切都值得了……"

translate schinese hscene9_Lyna_Helga_d286ea5a:
    n "在沉沉的睡眠中，她们期待着漫长夏日里还有更多这样的时刻。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_9e87befd:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{size=+10}{cps=20}新的一天开始了……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_06d0feae:
    hm "我好想你啊，亲爱的约翰……摸摸我。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_412a8537:
    hm "嗯……对，就是这样，好舒服！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_ee74b0af:
    hm "等等……我在哪？"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_3ad2c190:
    hm "我在别墅里，和我的孩子们一起……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_12f40f88:
    hm "我又梦见我丈夫了？！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_6590bc27:
    hm "咦，那是……？！不可能是他吧？"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_781a87b5:
    hm "对，是莱娜！昨晚我们一起睡着的……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_004b0c6f:
    hm "天啊，这也太尴尬了！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_623abda5:
    hm "我居然在梦里对她父亲做那种事……而她人就在这里……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_3ca7832b:
    hm "这时机真是糟透了！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_8cb4540b:
    hm "哎呀！她抱我抱得好紧。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_6345d048:
    hm "我该不该……叫醒她？不过她睡得很安稳。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_3f8f1878:
    hm "猜我们可以就这样再待一会儿。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_f2c99b8b:
    hm "我的小天使……她睡着的样子好可爱。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_75c5d632:
    hm "她的皮肤又软又滑……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_6eb97a0f:
    hm "我很怀念她还只是个孩子的时候……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_947dcb44:
    hm "没有别的烦恼，没有青春期的那些事，只有一个小不点黏着妈妈撒娇。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_08c6edc7:
    hm "那种时刻很稀少，却能无比温暖我的心。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_4a2975a8:
    hm "天啊，我后悔没有多陪陪他们……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_21d117aa:
    hm "在他们最需要我的时候，我却不在身边。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_15097760:
    hm "我得做个更好的妈妈，从今以后把他们的需要放在我自己的前面。也许那样我们这个家才能真正好起来。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_85200005:
    hm "哦！看来她找到了一个相当……亲密的抱法。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_4acd33b6:
    hm "我是说，我不能怪她。每个人寻求安慰的方式都不一样。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_33322e63:
    hm "而且她去年跟我说过她很孤独，所以……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_e673ab6d:
    hm "你知道吗，宝贝，没有你们两个，妈妈也很孤单……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_643e32b6:
    hm "不过我大概该叫醒她了，我们今天可有大事要办！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_0aedb58c:
    h "莱娜，宝贝，该起床了。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_765e2c96:
    l "{size=-10}唔嗯……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_ae9971d0:
    hm "对不起，小南瓜……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_ba9fd72e:
    hm "现在我觉得打扰你睡觉有点过意不去。"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_cec177b7:
    n "这位女士并不知道，莱娜远没有看上去那么无辜……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_6f5d43c7:
    l "{size=-5}{cps=20}再给我……多一点……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_38ee2994:
    hm "{size=+5}咦？！她……她刚才……！" with vpunch

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_75cb490d:
    l "{size=-5}{cps=20}来吧，{w=0.35}别害羞……"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_a43219aa:
    hm "我女儿在做什么梦？！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_cb3fd227:
    h "啊嗯~"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_8766d899:
    hm "{size=+5}天啊！这是什么？！"

translate schinese hscene10_Lyna_Helga_e461b6f8:
    hm "她还在睡吗？！她在摸我……摸我的胸！"

