    em "但妈妈好像完全不在意，真奇怪……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_2e88179d:
    n "赫尔加这位一贯溺爱儿子的母亲，为了确保儿子的舒适不遗余力：放好温度刚好的洗澡水，还加了些舒缓的浴盐。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_9e6c39a5:
    h "你来了！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7f1cb628:
    h "我都为你准备好了一切。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_50f04aea:
    e "谢谢妈。你真体贴。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_5564c133:
    h "当然了，宝贝。我的小宝贝什么都值得……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_d4bda99a:
    e "那……呃……你要下楼去吗……？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b772a124:
    e "我想我自己可以搞定。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_3dc605f0:
    h "别急！我来帮你脱上衣。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_6fee814f:
    e "什、什么？！不、不用！我自己会脱！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_ea7e5719:
    n "埃里克还没来得及抗议，母亲的手已经搭在他衬衫下摆上，轻轻向上拉着。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a828a9e0:
    em "她在干什么？！她不能就这样……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b2c55d1d:
    e "{size=+5}妈、妈，住手！你今天怎么了？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_6f2e79d5:
    h "哎，别说了！我只是想帮忙。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_e446be19:
    e "我知道……但我自己能搞定！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a49a5276:
    h "好了好了，跟自己妈妈还这么害羞。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_d51fd02c:
    h "你肯定觉得很虚弱，妈妈能做的至少就是帮你一点！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_d793ec1a:
    n "他呆立在那里，完全僵住了。尽管腰间围着浴巾，埃里克仍感到自己暴露无遗。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_05b6035f:
    n "他紧张的目光游移到母亲脸上，寻找任何不满的迹象……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c1b3ee2a:
    n "但迎接他的是温柔的神情，一个展现母爱的柔和微笑。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_6d861407:
    h "好了。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_73c27022:
    e "算是谢了……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_8231ee21:
    e "{size=+5}妈——！别盯着看！" with vpunch

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7e3661cc:
    h "哦，抱歉宝贝！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_607139ce:
    h "只是……你看……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b6335d28:
    h "现在我明白你昨天为什么不想脱衣服了，嘿嘿～"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_46f00b09:
    e "嗯？你有什么好羡慕的。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_07a739aa:
    e "你的身材比我好多了……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c9fcd9b4:
    h "嗯，我是说……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_3a474c41:
    h "大概吧，但你别妄自菲薄！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_2f68c4ee:
    h "我去年有很多空闲时间，而你一直在忙着学习。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_6c4acc02:
    h "还有听着，小甜心……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_cbece7b8:
    h "不管你在做什么，效果都相当不错。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c9098c3b:
    h "也许是你爸爸的基因吧，不过……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7138323b:
    h "我得说，儿子，你真是帅极了！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_4c3875c3:
    e "谢、谢谢妈……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c78d366f:
    n "赫尔加的目光在儿子身上流连，勾勒着他少年身躯的细微轮廓。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c9461daa:
    n "特别是他腹肌的微妙线条，以及……从薄浴巾下隐约露出的一丝耻毛。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_0aee8ec6:
    n "她没想到会看到这样的景象，儿子已经长成男人的事实，结结实实地击中了她的心。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b8ab46fb:
    n "那个她照顾了一辈子、无数次为他洗澡哄他入睡的小男孩……如今已是真正的青年男子。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7474a48c:
    hm "他真是他父亲年轻时的翻版……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_27b873f3:
    hm "但我觉得有很大的不同……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a659d317:
    hm "我知道他永远不会停止爱我，就像……就像约翰那样！天哪！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_90991a76:
    e "{size=-5}那……呃……我现在能去洗澡了吗？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_885c3c8a:
    h "好、好的，当然……但是……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_1569f2a8:
    h "或许你还需要更多帮助？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b5383ccf:
    h "要是你觉得虚弱，也许我可以帮你搓背……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_1f65c57e:
    e "{size=+10}妈，真的？！你快去吧！" with vpunch

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_56613297:
    e "{size=+5}真的，我这儿自己能搞定！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_3fa4f745:
    h "对不起宝贝！我不是故意让你不舒服的……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7e325bee:
    h "你还好吗？有什么想告诉我的吗？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_309af2f4:
    e "没、没有……我很好。抱歉大喊……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_f42a8148:
    e "妈，我很感激你的帮助，真的。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_83073f74:
    e "你知道我很喜欢你宠着我，但……我只是……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_5ea0a649:
    e "我需要一些空间，拜托。我今天不太舒服。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_ad83c545:
    h "没关系宝贝，我理解。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_0ea91a7a:
    h "但如果你觉得虚弱或不舒服，别犹豫，尽管叫我，好吗？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_18dc3d63:
    e "好的妈。谢谢。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_f9b71f30:
    h "好吧！那就交给你了。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_e8716d51:
    h "哦，如果我们不在楼下，大概在外面做瑜伽！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_d4d958c1:
    hm "希望我宝贝没事……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_d514c639:
    hm "我们改天得谈谈。我感觉有什么在困扰他。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_69110c67:
    em "刚才发生了什么？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_57e8c6f1:
    em "妈妈一向对我很亲近，但……这次有点过头了！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_eb05aed0:
    em "还有她看我的眼神……感觉几乎像——"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_160a84a7:
    em "{size=+5}不不不，不可能！" with hpunch

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_345bf2ce:
    em "一定是我想多了……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_38a57cdd:
    em "可为什么我摆脱不了那种感觉……？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_0fe02b1f:
    em "{size=+5}靠！莱娜真的把我脑子搞乱了！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_2fd58d4c:
    em "我想妈妈说得对，我确实需要泡个澡放松……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_b5e8c32a:
    em "啊……真舒服。我确实需要这个。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_573e26de:
    em "这几天压力太大，我头要炸了。真希望疼痛消失。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_40f7fbf5:
    em "说到我希望消失的东西……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_124ed86a:
    em "每次闭上眼，都看见她的脸，感受她的唇贴在我唇上。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c6160d5a:
    em "那一夜当时感觉美妙极了，但现在事后看来……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_1979d991:
    em "我太鲁莽、太不负责任了。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_c209f852:
    em "我不知道妈妈知道真相会怎么想。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_7b7d3675:
    em "她还会把我当成她最珍贵的儿子吗，还是会为我们做的事感到恶心？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a598e32a:
    em "谁会想到我的第一次真实体验会发生在自己双胞胎妹妹身上？简直荒谬！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_074a9038:
    em "但她回吻我的方式，还有她……{i}那样{/i}做的时候……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_895619b5:
    em "我以前从没经历过那样的事。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_80aacaa8:
    em "这是错的，是{size=+5}罪孽{/size}的，然而……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_1ef25807:
    em "我从没感到这么鲜活过，这么……被渴望。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_4d0c4e51:
    n "埃里克再一次向自己的念头投降，几乎凭着原始的本能，开始撸动着自己的肉棒。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_fb9f55de:
    n "他新发现的欢愉根本无法忘怀。它们吞噬着他，让他渴求更多。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_1e025cc3:
    n "妹妹舌间湿漉漉的味道，细腻肌肤的柔软，小嘴灼人的温热……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_5ddf89d5:
    em "如果我敢想一下……她愿意把事情推进到什么地步？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_9256cfbe:
    em "如果我——会不会更舒服——"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_ada2a788:
    em "不！我不敢相信我居然想了那个……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_6e52b573:
    em "靠，我是不是疯了？我不能让这个控制我……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_8b67471b:
    em "我真希望我们能回到以前那样。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_4985574a:
    em "她可能还在为昨天生气……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_21907897:
    em "可我还能怎么办？我不能就顺从她的要求。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_bbd3383a:
    em "靠！我太自私了！"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_cec8ed24:
    em "我渴望她，却又在把我们推开。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_9bd8f0b1:
    em "对不起，姐……但你得给我一点时间思考。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a23791ba:
    em "我得想办法让你看清现实，让你明白走这条路会有什么后果。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_4e19ca17:
    em "但如果莱娜不理解，最后永远恨我怎么办？！我受不了……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_395e658c:
    em "还有妈妈……我不可能告诉她我们的事，对吧？"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_5eb3ce93:
    em "这实在太疯狂了。我爱我妹妹，超过我愿意承认的……"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_861972d6:
    em "这一切对我来说都太新了，我不想再鲁莽行事。那不是我。"

translate schinese story30_Erik_Helga_a6765d94:
    em "也许我该鼓起勇气和妈妈谈谈……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_c7d39b01:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{size=+10}{cps=20}中午……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_4a986ce5:
    l "已经开始啦？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_3c0e4197:
    h "你来了！终于！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_1fad00e7:
    h "你可真慢……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_bbc6f318:
    l "抱歉，我没找到合适的衣服。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_9eed887e:
    l "所以你本来也打算不等我就开始做瑜伽……？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_eb38143b:
    h "当然不会！有个伴更有趣……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_d94415a4:
    h "而且你哥哥有点不舒服，所以只有你和我。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_0c7c4cbb:
    l "只有我们两个女生？听起来不错……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_8e158eac:
    l "你知道吗，我觉得今天会是美好的一天。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_232eb329:
    h "哦真的吗？为什么这么说？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_9d8d94bf:
    l "当然是女生的直觉啦！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_9a3867aa:
    h "嘿嘿～过来和我一起热身！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_dc76e2d6:
    h "亲爱的莱娜，你衣柜里就这些了吗？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_047f051e:
    l "是啊，怎么了？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_b0e295a6:
    h "我们得给你买些新运动服……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_df4455ac:
    h "那件是不是有点太小了？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_4f6b56b7:
    l "{size=+5}又来这套？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_30f16ff7:
    h "不不不，别担心！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_1e66fdb3:
    h "我只是想说……那明显不是你的尺码，对吧？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_1fb369a3:
    h "那是以前你小的时候的吗？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_4efceac1:
    l "呵，被你发现了。确实挺旧了……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_6c9f3b84:
    h "不过你穿着还是很可爱……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_64033719:
    l "你真这么想吗？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_da516fe5:
    h "是的，不过也许我们该去给你买套真正的瑜伽服。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e21e3d9a:
    h "我们甚至可以买配套的紧身衣，怎么样？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_19052199:
    l "哦哦？！那太酷了！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_462af9b3:
    h "哇！我不知道你这么灵活，莱娜！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_3abc0c20:
    l "嗯？你认真的？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_72c9a66a:
    l "是你在我还是个小不点的时候逼我去上那些愚蠢的芭蕾课的。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_8b6bb895:
    h "好了宝贝，别这么刻薄……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_cb138b83:
    h "你不是至少有一点喜欢吗？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_83bd037b:
    l "好吧……我承认没那么糟。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_ab6363a9:
    l "多亏它们我才会这些。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_f518b90f:
    h "嘿，那可不是「什么玩意儿」！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e5890d7d:
    h "而且亲爱的，保持身体健康非常重要。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_4e37dc90:
    l "好吧……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_f75d91ee:
    h "你知道，别看我年纪大，我也挺灵活的！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_d0296316:
    l "现在我可期待看了！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_8b21cdca:
    lm "靠，妈妈穿那身真好看……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_24d2f2bd:
    lm "她都四十多了还是这么健美自信！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_4ba3f649:
    lm "简直有点……让人望而生畏。我希望我老了也能那么辣。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_fff97133:
    lm "{size=+5}靠！我这是怎么了？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_8f9ad1e7:
    lm "和朱丽叶特那件事感觉不错，但不是我喜欢的类型。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_73cc3982:
    lm "但现在……我对亲生母亲也有了同样的冲动？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_b70a8858:
    lm "我真的是双性恋吗……？我不明白！为什么偏偏是她？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e67aa41e:
    lm "也许是因为她如此漂亮、智慧、成熟……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_eee2995a:
    lm "因为她在我身上看到了年轻的自己……也因为我一直想成为她那样，即便我们有过分歧。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_3ede3ae6:
    lm "我想这只是母女之间的事……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_22bceeab:
    lm "或者我只是因为他一再拒绝我，才把对埃里克的爱转移到了别人身上……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_c6eefda3:
    lm "可她比我大两倍还多，还是我亲妈！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_b4d341e9:
    lm "感觉……真他妈怪。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_fbed02a6:
    lm "等等，她是不是……在打量我？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_df9c427f:
    lm "看来妈妈终究还是喜欢这身衣服，嗯？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e0662610:
    lm "不过确实太紧了。我后悔没穿内裤。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_d4fefa2c:
    lm "但这还是我的错，对吧？我本可以用别的运动服，可却……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e3f0e5c8:
    lm "我现在穿这身说不定就是故意的，嘿嘿～"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_d6f7192d:
    h "啊！今天天气真好……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_917841b4:
    lm "得了吧，她明显是故意的！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_be571b6d:
    lm "她是不是就喜欢被人注意啊？！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_5c24db43:
    lm "但说真的，妈妈那样打扮还真是有点辣……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_ea5af826:
    lm "我倒不介意多看一点。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_23726e1b:
    lm "靠！我不敢相信自己老是这样看她，可是……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_8a7b73c4:
    lm "我妈简直就是熟女的教科书！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_cb0ff327:
    h "加油宝贝，别偷懒。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_46165ce7:
    h "再做几个就开始！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_2fb01d9d:
    lm "你爱怎么拉伸就怎么拉伸到天亮吧……"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_9d0b97c2:
    h "好了宝贝，准备好迎接内心的禅意了吗？"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_a77cc212:
    l "我准备好了，妈妈！"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_e8e0baf0:
    l "手下留情，我从没做过。"

translate schinese story31_Lyna_Helga_b5e4e8ff:
    h "别担心，我们从基础的开始。"

